ides by $(x-3)(x-6)$ gives\n\n$$\n-9x+36=-3(x-6)+B(x-3).\n$$\n\nFor $x=6$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-9(6)+36 & =-3(6-6)+B(6-3) \\\\ -18 & =3B \\\\ B & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-51137/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "450aebfe-d896-50bc-a392-e43aee7afabd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-51137"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-102552/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "0a466f58-d174-54fe-bb28-71e982bac178" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102552/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "6e03682f-d33a-5732-b219-286670bd466e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102552/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "02c831ce-1028-5bbf-abe4-3fff97f72a0b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102552/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "60e4f329-ec97-5c6e-a5b6-6c7db3afad5c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102552/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "a58b6499-9218-52c6-9238-1ddf6c6212e8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102552/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "342537e0-ef62-5329-82aa-ad262afbc3c4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-102552/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-102552/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" "q-102552/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-102552/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" "q-102552/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" "q-102552/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-102552" :question/id #uuid "30de06a3-978b-5217-b85e-0103eb7e6b72" :question/math-academy-id "q-102552" :question/problem "Given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{7{x}^{2}+20x+3}{(3x+2)(x-1)(x+5)}=\\frac{A}{(3x+2)}+\\frac{B}{(x-1)}+\\frac{C}{(x+5)},\n$$\n\nwhere $A,$ $B$ and $C$ are real constants, calculate $A+B+C.$" :question/worked-solution "Our task is to find $A,$ $B$ and $C$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7{x}^{2}+20x+3}{(3x+2)(x-1)(x+5)}=\\frac{A}{(3x+2)}+\\frac{B}{(x-1)}+\\frac{C}{(x+5)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(3x+2)(x-1)(x+5)$ gives\n\n$$\n7{x}^{2}+20x+3=A(x-1)(x+5)+B(3x+2)(x+5)+C(3x+2)(x-1).\n$$\n\nFor $x=-\\frac{2}{3}$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7{(-\\frac{2}{3})}^{2}+20(-\\frac{2}{3})+3 & =A(-\\frac{2}{3}-1)(-\\frac{2}{3}+5) \\\\  & \\,+B(3(-\\frac{2}{3})+2)(-\\frac{2}{3}+5) \\\\  & \\,+C(3(-\\frac{2}{3})+2)(-\\frac{2}{3}-1) \\\\ \\frac{28}{9}-\\frac{40}{3}+3 & =A(-\\frac{65}{9}) \\\\ -\\frac{65}{9} & =A(-\\frac{65}{9}) \\\\ A & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=1$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7(1)^{2}+20(1)+3 & =A(1-1)(1+5) \\\\  & \\,+B(3(1)+2)(1+5) \\\\  & \\,+C(3(1)+2)(1-1) \\\\ 7+20+3 & =B(30) \\\\ B & =\\frac{30}{30} \\\\ B & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=-5$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7(-5)^{2}+20(-5)+3 & =A(-5-1)(-5+5) \\\\  & \\,+B(3(-5)+2)(-5+5) \\\\  & \\,+C(3(-5)+2)(-5-1) \\\\ 175-100+3 & =C(78) \\\\ C & =\\frac{78}{78} \\\\ C & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B+C=1+1+1=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-102552/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7e66d7cf-1a4b-51e6-9c78-f70a8c0555df"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-102552"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-350932/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "fb4849f8-8f6d-557b-9afc-a67466c0fefb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-350932/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "1731aff4-e4c9-567f-b57c-8a4be0fbe240" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-350932/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-350932/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-350932" :question/id #uuid "a1b9c442-5b9b-599f-8823-37e850775cca" :question/math-academy-id "q-350932" :question/problem "Express $\\frac{3x}{(x-1)(x+2)}$ as a sum of partial fractions.\n\n| $\\frac{3x}{(x-1)(x+2)}=\\,$ | $1$ | $+$ | {{field-1}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $x-1$ |  | $x+2$ |" :question/worked-solution "Our task is to find $B$ such that\n\n$$\n\\frac{3x}{(x-1)(x+2)}=\\frac{1}{x-1}+\\frac{B}{x+2}.\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(x-1)(x+2)$ gives\n\n$$\n3x=(x+2)+B(x-1).\n$$\n\nFor $x=-2$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(-2) & =(-2+2)+B(-2-1) \\\\ -6 & =-3B \\\\ B & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{3x}{(x-1)(x+2)}=\\frac{1}{x-1}+\\frac{2}{x+2}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-350932/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "450aebfe-d896-50bc-a392-e43aee7afabd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-350932"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
